      "value": "I now also have some animator toggles on the FX layer which mysteriously work in Unity but not in VRChat, and the inability of this menu to show me the information makes it impossible to diagnose in-game.\nCan we at least have the menu automatically resize to be tall enough to fit the info? Having it insanely tall but able to show the info would be much better than it having a conservative height but being unusable.",
