      "value": "Same here as an avatar creator it’s so annoying I see an avatar that someone has made and want to see what kind of parameter toggle they made to achieve a certain effect just for it to be too low in the debug screen for me to see or even for some of my own avatars also some creators upload to quest first because they don’t have a good enough pc so it’s almost impossible for them to troubleshoot when things don’t work properly",
