  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-16T14:52:54.983Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The debug menu is handy, but I get a scrollbar on the right hand side of it and no input that I try will scroll the thing.\nHow it _should_ work: like any other scrollable UI panel.\nThe menu itself says \"Page Up\" and \"Page Down\" to scroll, but hitting those on a virtual keyboard while the VRChat window was focused didn't scroll the window either, so that's useless.\nI tried every other controller input available with no success, so I guess there is just no way to get to that second page right now.\nUnfortunately, the diagnostics I was looking for to figure out why my visemes were broken was on this second page.",
